  "id": "buttercup-squash-soup",
  "name": "Buttercup Squash Soup",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, herb-seasoned squash soup",
  "description": "Roasted buttercup squash joins sautéed onion, herbs, and cream cheese for a warming blended soup.",
